WEBVTT

00:00:52.519 --> 00:00:55.011
Arusu is now able to use
her magic really well, but...

00:00:55.121 --> 00:00:59.024
...she couldn't allow the warlock
cavalrymen to continue their violent ways.

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:03.119
So she got angry and attacked them
with lightning magic.

00:01:04.397 --> 00:01:06.729
She's against using
spells to hurt others...

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:08.665
...but she ended up using it.

00:01:09.035 --> 00:01:13.199
Arusu was very upset, but a
mysterious boy approached her.

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:17.237
His name is Sigma.

00:02:46.766 --> 00:02:50.134
Tweeny Witches

00:02:54.707 --> 00:02:59.110
Cursed Magic

00:03:02.448 --> 00:03:05.543
You shouldn't take it too easily.
It might be a fatal mistake.

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:08.416
Easy? Hard? What is this, a game?

00:03:08.621 --> 00:03:10.248
| don't care about that.

00:03:10.323 --> 00:03:13.418
We have to go!
Those fairies are captured, you know!

00:03:13.526 --> 00:03:14.550
What are you going to do?

00:03:14.661 --> 00:03:17.392
Apprentices shouldn't go
beyond that point...

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:20.922
That's right. They told us never to
go near the Fountain of Temptation.

00:03:21.034 --> 00:03:24.368
| thought you stopped
following rules made by others.

00:03:25.171 --> 00:03:26.229
Come with me.

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:27.669
I'll lead you there.

00:03:30.977 --> 00:03:33.378
This doesn't mean you have my trust.

00:03:33.479 --> 00:03:35.675
You think I'm leading you
to some kind of trap?

00:03:35.782 --> 00:03:38.274
| thought we understood
each other perfectly.

00:03:39.018 --> 00:03:41.919
You said you would only
do things for your benefit.

00:03:41.988 --> 00:03:44.685
Of course. I'm doing this
for my benefit.

00:03:45.091 --> 00:03:47.924
| became interested in her. That's all.

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:52.592
How come you decided to come along?

00:03:53.199 --> 00:03:54.166
I---

00:03:58.338 --> 00:03:59.271
Sheila?

00:03:59.806 --> 00:04:00.830
I'm not going.

00:04:00.907 --> 00:04:03.842
You can't back down!
You have to come with us, Sheila!

00:04:03.943 --> 00:04:06.913
But you're going to help the fairies.
If I come along...

00:04:07.013 --> 00:04:08.357
...then I'll just end up capturing them.

00:04:08.381 --> 00:04:09.925
...then I'll just end up capturing them.
But you have to come with us!

00:04:09.949 --> 00:04:11.678
But you have to come with us!

00:04:12.352 --> 00:04:13.820
You're one of us.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.787
That's why we have to stick together.

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:19.635
Hey, are we there yet?

00:04:19.659 --> 00:04:21.354
Hey, are we there yet?
We still have a long way to go.

00:04:21.427 --> 00:04:24.328
| mean, why is it so hot out here?

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:27.127
The place where we live
is much hotter than this.

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:29.328
What? I'm going to die!

00:04:29.435 --> 00:04:32.530
Let's take a break. I got it!
Let's eat some ice cream!

00:04:32.672 --> 00:04:35.573
Are you sure you can
rescue those fairies?

00:04:35.675 --> 00:04:38.337
| want some ice cream!

00:04:38.444 --> 00:04:39.240
Hey!

00:04:43.583 --> 00:04:44.593
Let's take a break.

00:04:44.617 --> 00:04:45.550
Let's take a break.
Hey!

00:04:50.256 --> 00:04:53.988
If we keep resting like this, they'll
transfer their base somewhere else.

00:04:54.093 --> 00:04:55.219
I know.

00:04:55.762 --> 00:04:56.820
Where is she?

00:04:59.432 --> 00:05:01.059
Um...

00:05:02.168 --> 00:05:04.068
Ah! All right!

00:05:04.370 --> 00:05:06.361
Here we go...

00:05:09.609 --> 00:05:11.839
Eva! I got water!

00:05:12.245 --> 00:05:13.235
You...

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:17.407
Are you kidding me? They don't
even have a convenience store!

00:05:17.550 --> 00:05:19.040
Hurry up and let her drink.

00:05:19.185 --> 00:05:20.084
Yes, sir!

00:05:22.255 --> 00:05:23.347
It's sweet!

00:05:23.456 --> 00:05:25.288
Could it be sugar water?

00:05:26.292 --> 00:05:27.919
Do you want some, Sheila?

00:05:28.561 --> 00:05:29.687
Yeah, thanks.

00:05:31.431 --> 00:05:33.092
What do you think you're doing?

00:05:33.199 --> 00:05:35.099
You're an anteria fairy!

00:05:35.435 --> 00:05:37.961
Oops! You're all witches?

00:05:39.639 --> 00:05:40.629
Damn it!

00:05:40.773 --> 00:05:41.750
| just escaped, you know!

00:05:41.774 --> 00:05:43.970
| just escaped, you know!
Should we capture him...

00:05:44.177 --> 00:05:45.804
...or let him go?

00:05:45.945 --> 00:05:47.923
Hey! He gave us water!

00:05:47.947 --> 00:05:48.505
Hey! He gave us water!
Right.

00:05:48.581 --> 00:05:49.625
He saved our lives!

00:05:49.649 --> 00:05:50.639
| did!

00:05:50.750 --> 00:05:55.916
Well, if he's one of you, then you
should make your standpoint clear.

00:06:02.495 --> 00:06:04.088
We know where we stand.

00:06:04.197 --> 00:06:06.097
We're not going to
let them have the fairy.

00:06:06.165 --> 00:06:10.033
That's right. If we don't capture them,
then we can't become an adult.

00:06:11.471 --> 00:06:13.132
Are you ready?

00:06:14.407 --> 00:06:15.272
Go!

00:06:19.178 --> 00:06:20.270
Eva!

00:06:24.584 --> 00:06:25.779
Take this!

00:06:26.819 --> 00:06:28.048
Sheila!

00:06:29.188 --> 00:06:30.087
Ready?

00:06:30.289 --> 00:06:31.188
Roger!

00:06:32.792 --> 00:06:33.335
Eva!

00:06:33.359 --> 00:06:34.326
Eva!
Eva!

00:06:34.694 --> 00:06:36.822
Hand over the fairy!

00:06:37.196 --> 00:06:38.561
Or else...

00:06:39.065 --> 00:06:43.298
I'll cast anti-lightning protection
on Eva. So use lightning magic!

00:06:43.436 --> 00:06:45.370
What are you saying?
That's too dangerous!

00:06:45.471 --> 00:06:46.961
Don't you want to save Eva?

00:06:47.073 --> 00:06:48.472
But I can't do that!

00:06:48.574 --> 00:06:50.702
Then you want to hand him our fairy?

00:06:50.777 --> 00:06:52.541
| don't want to do that, but...

00:06:57.383 --> 00:06:58.111
Let's go!

00:07:16.602 --> 00:07:19.128
Why did he have to fight the warlocks?

00:07:19.539 --> 00:07:22.372
He did it to save you people. No?

00:07:22.442 --> 00:07:25.605
But they belong to the same tribe.

00:07:25.878 --> 00:07:27.107
Here you go.

00:07:29.782 --> 00:07:32.012
You're an eccentric person.

00:07:32.151 --> 00:07:33.516
Well, see ya.

00:07:34.854 --> 00:07:37.050
Everyone else is eccentric.

00:07:40.393 --> 00:07:43.795
You betrayed your fellow warlocks
in order to save Eva.

00:07:44.831 --> 00:07:46.390
I'm sorry for doubting you.

00:07:46.499 --> 00:07:49.332
Then as your companion,
I'll give you fair warning.

00:07:49.569 --> 00:07:52.402
You shouldn't take her along with us.
She'll be a burden to us.

00:07:52.538 --> 00:07:53.903
Leave Eva behind?

00:07:54.006 --> 00:07:57.806
It will be much harsher from here on.
It could be fatal if she comes with us.

00:07:57.910 --> 00:07:59.955
But you went in and saved Eva...

00:07:59.979 --> 00:08:02.175
But you went in and saved Eva...
That was to gain your trust.

00:08:02.982 --> 00:08:06.680
I only do things that benefit me.
That's what I told you before.

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:11.147
You should hurry up and find something
that might be for your benefit.

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:24.964
Damn!

00:08:25.238 --> 00:08:26.069
What's wrong?

00:08:27.974 --> 00:08:28.566
Run!

00:08:29.108 --> 00:08:32.669
Wait a minute!
We don't have any fairies!

00:08:32.778 --> 00:08:33.889
Retaliation for yesterday.

00:08:33.913 --> 00:08:35.039
Retaliation for yesterday.
Retaliation?

00:08:35.114 --> 00:08:36.604
We got involved with them.

00:08:36.682 --> 00:08:39.549
This will never end if we don't
get rid of them for good!

00:08:39.652 --> 00:08:42.087
That's because you attacked them!

00:08:43.556 --> 00:08:45.752
Can't help it. Let's fight, Arusu!

00:08:45.858 --> 00:08:49.158
Wait a minute!
You have to be kidding me!

00:08:50.129 --> 00:08:51.028
Eva!

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:52.207
We have no choice!

00:08:52.231 --> 00:08:53.699
We have no choice!
But I don't want to!

00:08:53.799 --> 00:08:55.164
Don't you care about Eva?

00:08:55.234 --> 00:08:56.929
| want to save Eva, but...

00:08:57.036 --> 00:09:00.267
| don't want to hurt others
by using my magic!

00:09:00.373 --> 00:09:01.272
Let me go!

00:09:01.774 --> 00:09:04.436
We can't settle this with
your high-sounding ideas!

00:09:04.877 --> 00:09:06.641
When people are hurt by the...

00:09:06.712 --> 00:09:09.773
...use of magic, then they'll hate
magic till the day they die!

00:09:10.716 --> 00:09:12.309
| love it.

00:09:13.319 --> 00:09:15.287
| really love magic!

00:09:16.856 --> 00:09:21.384
| really don't want anyone to hate
something that I truly love!

00:09:24.330 --> 00:09:25.388
Arusu!

00:09:25.498 --> 00:09:26.829
Take this!

00:09:29.435 --> 00:09:30.129
Watch out!

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:31.637
Take this!

00:09:33.406 --> 00:09:34.373
Arusu!

00:09:34.774 --> 00:09:35.639
Sheila!

00:09:35.708 --> 00:09:36.675
Let's go!

00:09:41.814 --> 00:09:42.906
What is it?

00:09:43.249 --> 00:09:45.013
What's wrong with them?

00:09:45.985 --> 00:09:47.282
Pale Down.

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:48.146
What?

00:09:49.121 --> 00:09:50.247
These two...

00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:52.524
...are going to die in 24 hours.

00:10:00.232 --> 00:10:01.700
That's why I warned you.

00:10:01.801 --> 00:10:04.668
Bringing her along
would be a fatal mistake.

00:10:05.037 --> 00:10:08.268
Sigma. How could you say such a thing?

00:10:08.374 --> 00:10:11.241
You can't save fairies
if you only have 24 hours to live.

00:10:11.344 --> 00:10:12.311
Yeah, but...

00:10:13.112 --> 00:10:16.309
But we have to keep going forward.

00:10:16.449 --> 00:10:18.042
| can't be like this...

00:10:18.584 --> 00:10:24.023
| came along since you told me to.
But that's not good.

00:10:24.590 --> 00:10:29.323
I have to think of something
| want to do. Not what I have to do.

00:10:30.296 --> 00:10:32.094
Not for others.

00:10:32.498 --> 00:10:34.057
But for me.

00:10:38.537 --> 00:10:41.165
There is one way to save them.

00:10:43.075 --> 00:10:47.308
But you need the flower that only
grows in the Cave of Darkness.

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:49.107
I have to tell them!

00:10:49.215 --> 00:10:51.684
Don't waste your time giving them hope.

00:10:51.784 --> 00:10:54.583
But you said they can be
saved with that flower.

00:10:54.687 --> 00:10:57.622
You can't get there in 20 hours.

00:11:02.628 --> 00:11:04.357
We have trouble, Sheila!

00:11:06.799 --> 00:11:08.358
Eva is gone!

00:11:11.737 --> 00:11:16.072
No matter what kind of magic you use,
there is no way to stop time.

00:11:17.043 --> 00:11:18.772
16 hours left.

00:11:19.211 --> 00:11:22.806
Like it or not,
we only have 16 hours left.

00:11:32.658 --> 00:11:35.650
Tweeny Witches

00:11:40.199 --> 00:11:44.659
Eva's Courage

00:11:49.075 --> 00:11:50.372
Bark Mountain?

00:11:50.476 --> 00:11:51.910
Dark Mountain.

00:11:52.011 --> 00:11:54.878
Anyway, why didn't you
tell us about the flower?

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:56.425
There's no point telling you.

00:11:56.449 --> 00:11:58.144
There's no point telling you.
But Eva went...

00:11:58.217 --> 00:12:00.185
...to this Dark Mountain, right?

00:12:00.286 --> 00:12:01.947
I told her it was useless.

00:12:03.689 --> 00:12:06.852
Many warlock soldiers are
lurking in the Dark Mountain.

00:12:07.093 --> 00:12:11.894
She's never going to make it to the
end of the cave where the flower lies.

00:12:12.465 --> 00:12:17.335
Besides, in order to use that flower as
an antidote, you need a certain thing.

00:12:17.436 --> 00:12:19.495
What do you mean a certain thing?

00:12:19.572 --> 00:12:20.539
Mantra.

00:12:20.706 --> 00:12:24.370
But that mantra is only written
in the True Book of Spells.

00:12:25.678 --> 00:12:29.945
With 16 hours left to live, you better
think about what you're going to do.

00:12:30.249 --> 00:12:32.047
| have to go help Eva.

00:12:35.387 --> 00:12:36.752
Sheila!

00:12:41.827 --> 00:12:42.453
Huh?

00:12:43.062 --> 00:12:44.188
What is that?

00:12:53.939 --> 00:12:55.304
Guess who?

00:13:05.718 --> 00:13:07.482
Aren't you scared?

00:13:07.987 --> 00:13:09.284
Of course I am.

00:13:10.256 --> 00:13:15.126
One time, I cut school and
Yoko found out about it.

00:13:16.262 --> 00:13:20.699
Then she asked me, "If you're going to
die tomorrow, what do you want to do?"

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:22.734
If you were to die tomorrow?

00:13:22.935 --> 00:13:27.736
Yeah. Then I thought,
"What is this person thinking?"

00:13:28.507 --> 00:13:31.067
But now I understand what she meant.

00:13:31.210 --> 00:13:33.178
Now I can answer that question.

00:13:33.913 --> 00:13:37.713
If I were to die tomorrow,
I'll eat lots of chestnuts...

00:13:37.850 --> 00:13:42.515
...take care of Yoko
and sleep during class.

00:13:43.189 --> 00:13:45.749
I'm sure it's boring.

00:13:46.192 --> 00:13:49.389
| felt it was boring
when I did those things.

00:13:50.095 --> 00:13:52.120
But after I came here...

00:13:52.565 --> 00:13:54.260
Now that I can't go back...

00:13:54.433 --> 00:13:57.027
| realized after
missing all those things.

00:13:58.103 --> 00:14:02.506
Even if it's boring, I realized that
the boring things that I did every day...

00:14:02.741 --> 00:14:05.767
...were in fact the most
important things in my life.

00:14:06.545 --> 00:14:08.513
What Yoko asked me was...

00:14:08.614 --> 00:14:11.879
...what is the most
important thing in my life.

00:14:14.420 --> 00:14:15.410
Most...

00:14:17.323 --> 00:14:19.121
...important thing?

00:14:22.194 --> 00:14:23.787
Let's go help Eva!

00:14:23.896 --> 00:14:24.522
Okay!

00:14:28.834 --> 00:14:31.826
You shouldn't take her along with us.
She'll be a burden to us.

00:14:32.705 --> 00:14:36.608
It will be much harsher from here on.
It could be fatal if she comes with us.

00:14:40.246 --> 00:14:43.147
These two are going to die in 24 hours.

00:14:43.782 --> 00:14:48.083
That's why I warned you. Bringing
her along would be a fatal mistake.

00:15:02.835 --> 00:15:04.045
They went to the Eastern Forest...

00:15:04.069 --> 00:15:06.538
They went to the Eastern Forest...
Why are they here? What should I do?

00:15:10.943 --> 00:15:12.775
Looks like she went in from here.

00:15:14.013 --> 00:15:15.777
I'm telling you that it's impossible.

00:15:15.848 --> 00:15:18.647
Besides, do you even have
the True Book of Spells?

00:15:23.856 --> 00:15:24.914
What's wrong?

00:15:25.024 --> 00:15:26.150
This is Eva's.

00:15:27.426 --> 00:15:30.452
From the looks of things,
she probably gave up and left already.

00:15:30.963 --> 00:15:32.522
Eva kept going.

00:15:34.767 --> 00:15:38.863
She can't use magic, but she's
nicer than anyone I've ever known.

00:15:39.104 --> 00:15:40.230
Sheila.

00:15:40.739 --> 00:15:42.537
Let's go! Eva's waiting for us!

00:15:42.641 --> 00:15:43.369
Okay!

00:15:57.122 --> 00:15:57.953
Why?

00:15:58.524 --> 00:16:00.219
Why are they coming here?

00:16:06.765 --> 00:16:07.809
What's wrong, Sheila?

00:16:07.833 --> 00:16:08.425
What's wrong, Sheila?
Shh...

00:16:25.551 --> 00:16:26.814
Go away!

00:16:38.497 --> 00:16:41.660
A sparrow escape.

00:16:42.668 --> 00:16:45.296
A narrow escape. Let's move on.

00:17:00.519 --> 00:17:01.145
Huh?

00:17:02.821 --> 00:17:04.255
This is also Eva's!

00:17:09.194 --> 00:17:09.752
This way!

00:17:15.134 --> 00:17:16.295
Eva!

00:17:16.535 --> 00:17:17.297
Eva!

00:17:17.403 --> 00:17:18.246
We don't have much time!

00:17:18.270 --> 00:17:19.294
We don't have much time!
| know that!

00:17:19.438 --> 00:17:20.269
Sheila!

00:17:20.773 --> 00:17:22.138
Almost there...

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:25.002
Eva!

00:17:27.312 --> 00:17:28.211
Eva!

00:17:28.647 --> 00:17:30.274
Don't come any closer!

00:17:30.949 --> 00:17:33.782
Don't worry. I'll save you!

00:17:34.153 --> 00:17:37.350
I'm going to save both Sheila and Arusu!

00:17:39.024 --> 00:17:39.650
Eva...

00:17:40.459 --> 00:17:41.290
That's...

00:17:41.660 --> 00:17:43.458
That's because you're my friends!

00:17:44.763 --> 00:17:45.389
Eva!

00:17:52.137 --> 00:17:52.865
See?

00:17:53.472 --> 00:17:54.667
I did it!

00:17:54.940 --> 00:17:56.135
I did it!

00:17:59.545 --> 00:18:00.569
Arusu!

00:18:09.088 --> 00:18:10.317
Those girls...

00:18:25.938 --> 00:18:27.303
Are you okay?

00:18:29.908 --> 00:18:31.239
| got the flower.

00:18:31.343 --> 00:18:33.744
We'll just use the
True Book of Spells and...

00:18:35.848 --> 00:18:36.576
Huh?

00:18:37.916 --> 00:18:40.749
It's back to normal! Both of
your bodies are back to normal!

00:18:40.853 --> 00:18:42.184
We're saved?

00:18:42.788 --> 00:18:45.382
That's right! We've been saved!

00:18:45.924 --> 00:18:46.550
How?

00:18:46.658 --> 00:18:48.922
It's wonderful.

00:18:49.061 --> 00:18:52.053
This is all because of
the power of friendship...

00:18:52.164 --> 00:18:54.656
...the power of love,
and the power of effort.

00:18:56.268 --> 00:18:57.167
Paint?

00:18:59.138 --> 00:19:00.663
What's going on?

00:19:01.440 --> 00:19:03.340
That's how it is!

00:19:05.410 --> 00:19:08.038
Give me the True Book of Spells.

00:19:08.647 --> 00:19:10.479
So it was all a lie.

00:19:10.782 --> 00:19:14.412
About that flower and
how we're going to die in 24 hours.

00:19:14.686 --> 00:19:17.883
You approached us so that
you could get the True Book of Spells!

00:19:17.990 --> 00:19:19.480
Just hand it over.

00:19:19.591 --> 00:19:20.301
We don't have it.

00:19:20.325 --> 00:19:21.019
We don't have it.
Liar!

00:19:21.093 --> 00:19:22.026
But why?

00:19:22.861 --> 00:19:25.558
That book is meant for witches, right?

00:19:25.898 --> 00:19:27.263
Who is it for?

00:19:27.666 --> 00:19:29.896
I need it in order to save this realm.

00:19:29.968 --> 00:19:31.663
Save this realm?

00:19:31.937 --> 00:19:33.803
Saving the realm.

00:19:33.872 --> 00:19:37.103
Then the realm is... um...

00:19:37.309 --> 00:19:39.505
You lose, Eva!

00:19:44.683 --> 00:19:46.811
You probably don't believe me now.

00:19:47.085 --> 00:19:49.782
But you'll understand when
you come to Wizard Kingdom.

00:19:50.422 --> 00:19:51.150
What?

00:19:51.256 --> 00:19:53.350
It's the Warlock Realm.

00:19:53.458 --> 00:19:54.619
| see.

00:19:54.927 --> 00:19:55.553
Hey.

00:19:56.662 --> 00:19:59.723
You'll understand why I want
the True Book of Spells...

00:19:59.831 --> 00:20:02.391
...and why we capture fairies.

00:20:03.068 --> 00:20:07.164
You'll understand everything...

00:20:16.582 --> 00:20:24.546
Come on, let's go!
Without closing our eyes...

00:20:24.790 --> 00:20:32.790
Our singing and laughter
fill the vast sky.

00:20:33.966 --> 00:20:41.966
We're headed for
our greatest longings.

00:20:43.208 --> 00:20:48.772
There's no wish
that can't come true.

00:20:48.880 --> 00:20:53.113
Let's just believe and fly away!

00:20:53.885 --> 00:20:58.118
No matter how hopeless it seems...
If we wish hard enough...

00:20:58.223 --> 00:21:02.785
See, it'll turn info magic.

00:21:02.995 --> 00:21:08.161
Even the tiniest dream...
If it can bring somebody joy...

00:21:08.267 --> 00:21:11.328
Let's hope it does.

00:21:12.804 --> 00:21:17.435
Hey! DuDiDuWa...
We're laughing always, lalala...

00:21:17.542 --> 00:21:20.034
Let's sing your song and
smile and laugh with me.

00:21:20.145 --> 00:21:28.145
The truth is we're all waiting...

00:21:29.321 --> 00:21:35.055
...for the world of our dreams.

00:21:35.160 --> 00:21:39.324
So we might as well
Just make one of our own!
